[{"title":"甲申二月二十三日问马坰野寓宝坻公署有感时令君曹公将内召","author":"申佳允","text":"山映崆峒带远晖，晴楼沙树昔年非。\n地经烽火寒烟乱，鸟积斜阳塞草肥。\n古梵疏钟声绕梦，孤城细雨泪沾衣。\n春风信宿神明宰，又复搴惟傍紫薇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21064,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月十一日宿天宁寺","author":"申佳允","text":"妙香疏磬宕新烟，花雨霏微一澹然。\n餐素相人犹相马，泪馀忧国更忧天。\n村帘寒食悬千里，竹院浮生悟小年。\n鸟静孤云衔塔影，青岚窈窕夕阳还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21065,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江晚唱","author":"申佳允","text":"江头欸乃声，惊散寒云影。\n渔竿挂夕阳，月照芙蓉冷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21066,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访友不遇","author":"申佳允","text":"廛市厌烦嚣，偶来幽寂处。\n水流半掩扉，坐久却忘去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21067,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日有怀 其一","author":"申佳允","text":"秋水连天际，鹜飞带晚霞。\n景中人不见，惆怅咏蒹葭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21068,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日有怀 其二","author":"申佳允","text":"室迩宁分水，人遐似隔山。\n苍苔馀蔓草，谁与叩柴关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21069,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴集古 其一","author":"申佳允","text":"秋色正潇洒，高斋闻雁来。\n我心渺无际，随意坐莓苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21070,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴集古 其二","author":"申佳允","text":"明月高秋迥，徘徊祗自知。\n凉风吹夜雨，摇荡菊花期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21071,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴集古 其三","author":"申佳允","text":"日暮秋风起，遥闻横笛音。\n凭高何限意，萧瑟动寒林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21072,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴集古 其四","author":"申佳允","text":"升高临四野，秋色老梧桐。\n索莫竟何事，清川思不穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21073,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴集古 其五","author":"申佳允","text":"白露沾人袂，秋风落日斜。\n忧来谁共语，烂醉是生涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21074,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴集古 其六","author":"申佳允","text":"野树苍烟断，人閒月影清。\n山空松子落，淅沥度秋声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21075,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴集古 其七","author":"申佳允","text":"寂寞书斋里，萧萧送雁群。\n弹琴复长啸，情发为知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21076,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴集古 其八","author":"申佳允","text":"天际秋云薄，床前明月光。\n无由一化羽，回立白苍苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21077,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意 其一","author":"申佳允","text":"纤纤弄玉盆，月挂垂杨树。\n盆中影似郎，几回捉不住。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21078,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意 其二","author":"申佳允","text":"郎去几时还，抛奴情忒寡。\n咒郎鹦鹉嗔，频叫哥哥打。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21079,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其一","author":"申佳允","text":"独伴奚奴行，为予拖竹杖。\n云深游兴阑，扶尔青山上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21080,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其二","author":"申佳允","text":"兀坐不张琴，仰看山色渺。\n其中音自看，尘世知者少。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21081,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生子回文","author":"申佳允","text":"明月映弧桑，凤麟钟气香。\n擎杯喜夜永，熳烂启祯祥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21082,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺情","author":"申佳允","text":"门前绿柳飞絮，帘外红桃落花。\n寂寞不知因甚，颦眉悄对窗纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21083,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昼寝 其一","author":"申佳允","text":"三春未了途债，千里忽萦客心。\n午榻一床蝶梦，莲湾两部蛙吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21084,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昼寝 其二","author":"申佳允","text":"马蹄周回曲巷，客屐踏碎庭阴。\n拂簟聊消暑气，敲冰暂涤尘襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21085,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昼寝 其三","author":"申佳允","text":"汲水呼奴煮茗，下帘任我抛书。\n莫愁迎宾倒屣，百官薄暮斋居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21086,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昼寝 其四","author":"申佳允","text":"奔走以劳而倦，栖迟惟静则清。\n閒窗再寻午梦，奚奴莫下棋声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21087,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"搏云吟 其一","author":"申佳允","text":"烧云烁火雪冰敲，雾市烟楼撞海潮。\n寒透玻瓈香透水，凌虚丹阁紫雯招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21088,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"搏云吟 其二","author":"申佳允","text":"冶岚浓澹竹风閒，万派红光迸火然。\n惊眼怒涛声触树，千层旭霭一晴川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21089,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"搏云吟 其三","author":"申佳允","text":"月影瞿瞿鹤影疏，雨帘清閟净名书。\n虎狼喝夜蛟螭舞，十丈酸风不怖余。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21090,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"搏云吟 其四","author":"申佳允","text":"波纹苔绣艳高春，青枣黄芽混沌人。\n笑破莲花踏秋雨，白茅双屐紫阳巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21091,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"搏云吟 其五","author":"申佳允","text":"琥珀光瑩绿雪烹，漱松嚼石咀霜英。\n凌空缥缈群岩静，谱尽千春海岳程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21092,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"搏云吟 其六","author":"申佳允","text":"山阁高严带雨眠，鹿踪鸥迹伴壶天。\n茫茫大地炎云毒，抱影萧疏玉麈寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21093,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"搏云吟 其七","author":"申佳允","text":"风云法界电雷书，俯仰苍渊碧玉除。\n甲子火流晴雨速，閒消静息验居诸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21094,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"搏云吟 其八","author":"申佳允","text":"惊虹灼灼碾车尘，高揖氤氲演谷神。\n姑射逍遥风月主，湖山介绍我为宾。","collect