8286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水平感赋","author":"申佳允","text":"依然河上一舟横，去月茫茫此月平。\n回首风涛转眼定，凭虚一任自然行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21114,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"于蕃侄备兵颖上过仪信宿","author":"申佳允","text":"丝纶新下五云间，剑佩翩翩侍从班。\n屐踏衙斋惊齿折，铙歌吹送八公山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21115,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀卢邻虚","author":"申佳允","text":"南浦春深汎鹢舟，烟光树色午桥头。\n吟魂幻作清漳梦，舄影双飞刻凤楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21116,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿小宋","author":"申佳允","text":"一带河流抱浚城，寒烟野杵古林平。\n依稀渡蚁桥头月，照破尘颜一榻清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21117,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻邹县大兄谪官","author":"申佳允","text":"风尘潦倒折腰难，回首浮云问鹖冠。\n梦入寒庐惊夜雨，池塘诗思落河干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21118,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭贾襄一","author":"申佳允","text":"三载惭无赫赫名，去时赢得士民情。\n相思一夜并州梦，月色秋声满故城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21119,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕雨雪戏占 其一","author":"申佳允","text":"自从年里看春后，日盼元宵恣笑游。\n到得试灯忙栉沐，风吹雪片打帘钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21120,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕雨雪戏占 其二","author":"申佳允","text":"元夕燃灯阴亦暖，红裙谁耐坐深闺。\n只因笙管吹心去，新著春鞋不怕泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21121,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕雨雪戏占 其三","author":"申佳允","text":"灯花影里如云乱，笑语喁喁怕失群。\n冶兴未阑鸡早唱，床头盼杀醉郎君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21122,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕雨雪戏占 其四","author":"申佳允","text":"烟火光残人渐少，归家箫鼓梦中闻。\n明朝收起新花钿，只到清明始上坟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21123,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游黄梁祠即景杂咏 其一","author":"申佳允","text":"传来仙迹在仙祠，惹得痴人望更痴。\n一遇乔妆魔道士，几回呆盼授青磁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21124,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游黄梁祠即景杂咏 其二","author":"申佳允","text":"日日青驹不断尘，却于此地说仙因。\n遍看四壁题诗客，半是当年学步人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21125,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游黄梁祠即景杂咏 其三","author":"申佳允","text":"石像玲珑仰面看，纷纷踏碎碧香龛。\n摩来摩去浑无动，毕竟卢生睡得酣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21126,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游黄梁祠即景杂咏 其四","author":"申佳允","text":"行行古道问仙踪，驴背驮来睡眼矇。\n莫道仙缘非易结，仙乡今在睡乡中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21127,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卢十二竹枝词十二首 其一","author":"申佳允","text":"梅花破腊发琼枝，乍转东风淡荡时。\n天上恰开王母宴，仙郎醉捧紫金卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21128,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卢十二竹枝词十二首 其二","author":"申佳允","text":"金谷春光烂锦丝，和风吹拂万年枝。\n碧云名谪青云里，玉液恩浓太液池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21129,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卢十二竹枝词十二首 其三","author":"申佳允","text":"花枝浓淡映青阳，把酒轻浮琥珀光。\n愿得年年春色懒，红梅香递九霞觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21130,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卢十二竹枝词十二首 其四","author":"申佳允","text":"轻烟晴日百年初，五色玄芝产玉除。\n学得长生丹已熟，蓬莱何事觅仙书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21131,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卢十二竹枝词十二首 其五","author":"申佳允","text":"瑞云渺渺葛山巅，柳软花柔艳雪天。\n太白谪来尘世里，阳春一曲吐青莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21132,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卢十二竹枝词十二首 其六","author":"申佳允","text":"潇洒卢生意自如，樽前今日问何吁。\n想因素室传书后，天半飞来素女无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21133,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卢十二竹枝词十二首 其七","author":"申佳允","text":"何姑曾共泛螺舟，咫尺相思天际悠。\n恨杀青鸾无处觅，春风醉过岳阳楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21134,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卢十二竹枝词十二首 其八","author":"申佳允","text":"云隔巫山十二峰，玄霜独酌醉思浓。\n莫愁应早归金屋，织女何须七夕逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21135,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卢十二竹枝词十二首 其九","author":"申佳允","text":"章台柳色应知改，回首青青可奈何。\n莫恨瑶台无尔伴，云中好去觅仙娥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21136,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卢十二竹枝词十二首 其十","author":"申佳允","text":"西行怪道懒于云，方朔原来为细君。\n但得玄珠生老蚌，何劳飞舄渡河汾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21137,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卢十二竹枝词十二首 其十一","author":"申佳允","text":"白玉仙童吹紫鸾，飞来次第落洺干。\n他年乱舞琼筵上，赢得吴姬笑眼看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21138,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠卢十二竹枝词十二首 其十二","author":"申佳允","text":"不献蟠桃唱竹枝，愿君富寿更多儿。\n明春再祝长安道，同上红楼续旧词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21139,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何处难忘酒","author":"季科","text":"何处难忘酒，兰舟带雨维。\n一从梁苑别，六隔武陵期。\n晓梦梨花断，春愁燕子知。\n此时无一盏，谁与话相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21140,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日过黄桥","author":"季科","text":"浅浦芦花出蔡泾，石梁潮长木兰轻。\n一番凉雨钓丝乱，何处晚风渔笛清。\n云外水庄刚十里，渡头灯火欲初更。\n榜人不睡算程到，自唱楚歌摇月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21141,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入三竺","author":"季科","text":"笋舆斜日看山行，迢递禅林入径清。\n岩际暝烟连竹色，涧边流水助松声。\n三生寺古多灵迹，五岭云深不辨名。\n欲借蒲团供一宿，木兰来促泛湖轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21142,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]